OL,3,GNEWSAHope but not yet belief on
OL,4,ABradford's streets for railway station
OL,5,Areboot
OL,6,
OL,7,FPlans for a new railway station in
OL,8,FBradford have been welcomed by
OL,9,Fpassengers, businesses and political
OL,10,Fleaders in the city. However questions
OL,11,Fremain about how it will operate, and
OL,12,Fwhether, after years of setbacks, it
OL,13,Fwill finally be delivered.
OL,15,FOn a weekday lunchtime at Bradford
OL,16,FInterchange, a steady stream of trains
OL,17,Frumble in and out, collecting and
OL,18,Fdelivering passengers at the site's
OL,19,Ffour platforms.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
