OL,3,GNEWSAHope but not yet belief on
OL,4,ABradford's streets for railway station
OL,5,Areboot
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe station, built in the 1970s, is one
OL,8,Fof two in the city. The other, less
OL,9,Fthan a mile away, is the smaller
OL,10,FForster Square.
OL,12,FI see for myself the considerable flow
OL,13,Fof passengers going about their days,
OL,14,Fbut, for one of the UK's largest
OL,15,Fcities, the station itself does feel
OL,16,Fsurprisingly small.
